# Vite bundles are content-hashed; a missing /assets file means a stale
# index.html (old tab or cache), not a route. Answer a real 404 instead of
# the SPA fallback, so the browser fails fast instead of complaining that an
# HTML page is not a JavaScript module.
/assets/*    /404.html    404

# Single-page app: every client-side route falls back to index.html.
/*    /index.html   200
